  title: The authorized view
  category: ARCHIVE / 03-01 / SYSTEM RECORD
  body: 'ACCESS LOG / 03-A


    The observation corridor is cleared for survey personnel.
    Work areas beyond the glass remain outside the inspection route.


    Visible
    from here: an orderly structure. Missing from this record: the people who worked
    inside it.'
